        "de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Still Have Questions?",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "mail",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>If you have any questions about fitment, carry position, or anything else, email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@southedc.store\">support@southedc.store</a> \u2014 we're happy to help you make an informed decision before you buy.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_yMkFYj": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Features",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>A faux-leather IWB designed around the one thing most holsters can't solve: all-day comfort against skin.</strong> Covers the grip, wicks sweat, flexes with your body \u2014 not against it.</p><ul><li>Full-grip back panel \u2014 soft faux leather covers the grip so metal doesn't bite skin</li><li>Dual reinforced metal clips \u2014 pistol doesn't swing or shift during movement</li><li><strong>FREE mag carrier included</strong> ($20 value) \u2014 no add-on needed</li><li>Tuckable \u2014 shirt tucks cleanly over the clips for dress-code environments</li><li>Carry positions: 10 o'clock to 5 o'clock (Appendix carry performs best with the breakout draw)</li><li>30-day risk-free money back guarantee</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_xaD8cE": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & Delivery",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>FREE U.S. shipping on every order.</strong></p><ul><li>Order processing: 1\u20132 business days</li><li>Standard U.S. delivery: 3\u20137 business days after dispatch</li><li>Tracking number emailed as soon as your holster leaves the warehouse</li><li>Shipped from the U.S.A.</li></ul><p>Questions about your order? Reach us at <a href=\"mailto:support@southedc.store\">support@southedc.store</a> \u2014 we reply within one business day.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
