        "text_BLPgBK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Precision built with premium American materials and our engineered breakout channel that lets you draw instantly with the flick of the wrist even when you\u2019re pinned or overpowered. Designed slim and comfortable for all day carry so you are always ready, whether alone, with your kids, or facing the unexpected.</p><p>See Phantom IWB 2.0 in action in the video below.</p>"
