          }
        },
        "text_mcfHPM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In 2015, Kevin and his sons, Mike and Musk, moved to Chicago, where protecting his family became essential. Frustrated with bulky holsters, he began modifying and eventually building his own \u2014 leading to the breakout channel for lightning-fast draw speeds. The design quickly gained popularity locally.</p><p>Now, over 10 years later, SouthEDC remains proudly veteran-owned and family-operated, handcrafting premium holsters in Greensboro, North Carolina.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
