    "collapsible_content_pH4gBH": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_Ek4ejb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What carry positions is the Phantom 2.0 compatible with?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The Phantom 2.0 is designed to be versatile, working anywhere from the 10 o'clock position (opposite-side appendix carry) all the way to the 5 o'clock position, just before the center of your back. This gives you flexibility for different carrying preferences. Note: the breakout draw performs best in the appendix carry position.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YBMXqj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What belt size does it work with?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The Phantom 2.0 fits up to a 1.5-inch gun belt. A 1.5-inch gun belt is recommended for best use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DrfwEw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it work with rail-mounted lights/lasers?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The Phantom 2.0 is currently available in non-light-bearing options only.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Kc8eLN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it compatible with red dots, night sights & top-mounted optics?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes \u2014 the Phantom 2.0 is compatible with red dots, night sights, and top-mounted optics.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_THYzTb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it work with threaded barrels?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The Phantom 2.0 currently works with flush-fitting barrels only.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LhdeUm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it work with gas pedal attachments?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The Phantom 2.0 does not currently work with gas-pedal attachments.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TYW7pT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What color is the Phantom 2.0 offered in?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>At the moment, the Phantom 2.0 is offered exclusively in Flat Black.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_eGxyQV": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will the retention loosen up over time?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Retention on the Phantom 2.0 changes very little over time \u2014 if you carry at the factory medium draw, it will hold that level of retention for years.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jViWGx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I adjust the retention level of the holster?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>At SouthEDC, we've prioritized comfort, concealment, and reliability in our design. Instead of compromising concealment with bulky retention screws, nuts, and grommets, we've opted for a sleek, robust steel-riveted retention system. This fixed retention delivers consistent performance over the long term, tuned to a medium draw \u2014 a balance of security and accessibility. Your firearm will audibly \"click\" into place, giving you ample retention during daily carry.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_AdDkFi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I return the Phantom 2.0 if it doesn't meet my expectations?",
            "icon": "check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>We know finding the right holster matters. If for any reason you're not completely satisfied with your Phantom 2.0, we offer a 30-day risk-free return and refund policy. Contact our customer service team within 30 days of receiving your order to start the return. Once we receive your item in its original condition, we'll process a full refund of the product to your original payment method. Please note that shipping costs are non-refundable.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
